{\b Try ArrowKeys}
\par Open ArrowKeys in Applications and allow it in Privacy & Security > Accessibility. ArrowKeys maps Caps Lock to Option on connected keyboards, including keyboards attached while it is running. For automatic startup, select Open at Login in the ArrowKeys menu. When upgrading from the Karabiner edition, remove the old ArrowKeys rule in Complex Modifications.
}
